{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":33,"ref":"2-chronicles 18:33","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"yo","chapter":18,"translation":"Àti ènìyàn kan fún bọ̀́ láti orùn ṣófúnnu, ó lu ⟨את⟩ ọba Israẹli láàárín àwọn ìsopọ̀ àti láàárín àwọn apààbó ẹ̀jẹ́, ó sì wí fún aṣọ́-ọkọ̀ ọ̀ṣẹ́ pé: Yí ọwọ́ rẹ kọ̀, kí o sì gbée mi jáde kúrò nínú ogun, nítorí pé mo ti gbéṣẹ́.","tokens":[{"surface":"ואיש","gloss":"Àti ènìyàn kan"},{"surface":"משך","gloss":"fún bọ̀́ láti orùn"},{"surface":"בקשת","gloss":"ṣófúnnu"},{"surface":"לתמו","gloss":"láti orùn"},{"surface":"ויך","gloss":"ó lu"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"ọba Israẹli"},{"surface":"מלך","gloss":"ọba"},{"surface":"ישראל","gloss":"Israẹli"},{"surface":"בין","gloss":"láàárín"},{"surface":"הדבקים","gloss":"àwọn ìsopọ̀"},{"surface":"ובין","gloss":"àti láàárín"},{"surface":"השרין","gloss":"àwọn apààbó ẹ̀jẹ́"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"ó sì wí"},{"surface":"לרכב","gloss":"fún aṣọ́-ọkọ̀ ọ̀ṣẹ́"},{"surface":"הפך","gloss":"Yí"},{"surface":"ידיך","gloss":"ọwọ́ rẹ kọ̀"},{"surface":"והוצאתני","gloss":"kí o sì gbée mi jáde"},{"surface":"מן","gloss":"kúrò nínú"},{"surface":"המחנה","gloss":"ogun"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"nítorí pé"},{"surface":"החליתי","gloss":"mo ti gbéṣẹ́"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-23T05:29:52.411744269Z","model":"glm-5.3"}